  "description": "1 RU secure SD-WAN appliance with 20 Gbps firewall and 11.5 Gbps IPsec throughput on the purpose-built SD-WAN ASIC: 18 x 1G RJ-45 ports (MGMT/DMZ, WAN1-WAN2, HA1-HA2 and port1-12), four 1G SFP cages (13-16), four RJ-45/SFP shared pairs (17-20) where only one half of each pair can be used, and two 10G SFP+ FortiLink ports (X1-X2). No expansion slots.",
